  <item>
    <title>我们都得了一种叫“麻木”的通病，只能治愈5%｜第9眺</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6327fc18aafc5c394512df3e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6327fc18aafc5c394512df3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Sep 2022 05:20:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是“职场小眺岛”的第9期节目。必须承认，我们都得了一种叫“麻木”的病，对于每天呈报的数字、天灾、人祸、涨跌等信息都无法引起心中的波澜，后来发现原来是一种“通病”，也就放心了点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期刚好聊的是“疗愈与改变”，除了“麻木”，关于自我、亲密关系、原生家庭、职场人际等系列问题已经应接不暇了，先解决哪个呢？我们用一场只有5%效果的疗愈来试图找找答案。（本期标题只是有感而发，与内容没有多大关系。）</span><br><span></span><br><span></span><strong><span>🎤 本期主播</span><br><span></span></strong><span>CC &nbsp;：潮汕不倒翁</span><br><span>“媒体-&gt;经纪人-&gt;创业-&gt;媒体-&gt;互联网”10年职场经验</span><br><span>派派：南京小胖仔</span><br><span>“媒体-&gt;互联网”3年职场经验</span><br><span></span><strong><span>职场小眺岛-第9眺</span></strong><span>音频：</span><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4312">01:11:52</a></span><br><span></span><br><span></span></em><span>音乐 | Linkin Park《Numb》</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳ 时间线</span></p><span></span><p><br><span></span><strong><span>先讲结论：所有人只能解决自己的课题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a> </span><strong><span>状态排查</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>对学习无动力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>对真实世界无兴趣</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>对社交无能力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>对生命价值无感受</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> </span><strong><span>短期主义的症结</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>急于一飞冲天的过度自信</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>迫切想与过去的自己决裂</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>立下的flag像一块遮羞布</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>幻想完美却仍停留在原点</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> </span><strong><span>长期主义的方案</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>正视自己</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>接受最坏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>理解惯性</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>拉长周期</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>搅动节点</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>恢复功能</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>最小行动</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>-CC的问题与分享</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>自我认知（CASE：拖延症）To Do：</span></strong><span>拆解最小行动，减少心理负担，找到向上螺旋</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>亲密关系（CASE：诈尸式育儿）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>To Do：</span></strong><span>直面问题，借助道具，表达诉求，放手信任，给予空间</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>职场生存（CASE：恐惧权威）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>To Do：</span></strong><span>用黑色想象接受最坏结果，摆正角色，做好功课</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-派派的问题与分享</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>自我认知（CASE：想太多&amp;躺平还是卷）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>To Do：</span></strong><span>找到脑中的小虫子拒绝失焦，聆听不同部分想要什么，用“十法则”帮助决策</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>原生家庭（CASE：强势的妈妈）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>To Do：</span></strong><span>传递明确信号，找到各自的焦点，接受守护而非全盘负责</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>人际关系（CASE：社恐的烦恼To Do：</span></strong><span>不用对抗来惩罚自己，找到动因，去除干扰项</span><strong><span>【写在最后】</span></strong><span>这一期是上周四录制的，分享的是我们读李松蔚老师的《5%的改变》一书的思考，这不是批改作业，没有绝对答案，希望能给你提供一个小豁口，走出第一步，从5%开始。</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>图片 from pixabay.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐 | Linkin Park《Numb》</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎分享你的5%改变。</span><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg19NAtrIVtoDuf2jPTE2WttS0jh.m4a" length="104322901" type="audio/mp4"/>
